<section class="section--surface" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="label">FAQ</span>
    <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>How do I access my plans in TrainingPeaks?</h3>
      <p>All-Access is delivered through your TrainingPeaks account, not through this site. Log in there (web or app) with the email you subscribed with, and go to <strong>Plans → Explore</strong> to see the full catalog. Assign whichever one you want to your calendar — with All-Access you can switch plans as often as you like. TrainingPeaks Premium is already included on the same account.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Are the downloadable guides available in English?</h3>
      <p>Not yet — the three downloadable guides (nutrition, mental preparation, zones) currently exist in Spanish only. English versions are part of the same build as the library above. Email us if you'd like one in the meantime.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>I forgot my password. How do I get back in?</h3>
      <p>Use the <a href="/members/en/forgot-password/">password recovery page</a> — enter the email you subscribed with and we'll resend your access.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>How do I manage or cancel my subscription?</h3>
      <p>Your subscription is handled directly in TrainingPeaks Payments — billing, changes and cancellation all happen in your TrainingPeaks account, not here.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>What exactly does All-Access include?</h3>
      <p>All 300+ training plans across every sport, distance and language, unlimited plan changes, TrainingPeaks Premium, the downloadable guides, and this tools library — all for one monthly subscription.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
